        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following an epic smoke, a group of stoner friends (and their cat) are catapulted into another dimension, where the prohibitionist Empire and the pro-cannabis Resistance fight each other with no holds barred.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To return home they will have to find Baron Ganja, leader of the Resistance. And this will not be the end of the adventure, but only the beginning...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleport to Inagar and you too will wonder... What does Ace Ventura have to do with The Lord of the Rings? What does the Great Yogurt do in the Room of Spirit and Time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All this, and much more, is Ganja Quest RPG!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 90s JRPG style adventure, open world with turn-based combat, a main quest and numerous side quests that will allow the player to collect unique tools with which to equip their party.</p>",
